  "seoTitle": "Sufmi Dasco Ahmad Potential Vice President Candidate",
  "metaDescription": "Discussions regarding the selection of a new vice president to succeed Gibran Rakabuming Raka continue as Sufmi Dasco Ahmad gains political support.",
